  "legalDraftNotice": "Draft text, to be reviewed by LUTIANO's legal adviser before the app is released.",
  "termsBody": "## Who these terms are for\nThese terms apply to customers of LUTIANO Coffee who use this app.\n\n## Your account\nYour account is personal. Keep your password and codes private. You are responsible for what is done with your account.\n\n## Orders\nAn order is a request to a LUTIANO sales point. It is accepted by the seller and paid at the sales point. Prices and availability are those shown at the sales point when you order.\n\n## Rewards\nPoints and rewards follow the rules shown in the app. They have no cash value and can expire.\n\n## Acceptable use\nUse the app for your own purchases only. Do not try to reach data that is not yours or disturb the service.\n\n## Closing your account\nYou can delete your account from the app at any time. LUTIANO may suspend an account that does not respect these terms.\n\n## Changes and contact\nThese terms may change; the app will show the new version.",
  "privacyBody": "## What we keep about you\nYour name, phone number, email address if you give one, language, the orders you place and the points you earn. If you sign in with Google or Apple we keep the identifier they give us.\n\n## Why we use it\nTo prepare your orders, give you your rewards, keep your account safe and answer your requests. We do not sell your data.\n\n## Notifications\nWe keep your phone's notification token to tell you about your orders and rewards. Offers are sent only if you agreed.\n\n## Who can see it\nLUTIANO staff, within what their role needs, and the services we use to send SMS and notifications.\n\n## How long we keep it\nOrder records are kept as long as the accounts require. When you delete your account your personal details are removed.\n\n## Your choices\nYou can change your details, language and consent in the app, and delete your account.\n\n## Security\nYour session is kept in your phone's secure storage and ends when you log out.",
